<p>I=E2=80=99m a machine learning engineer with over 20 years of experience=
. I=E2=80=99ve worked at Airbnb and GitHub, including early LLM <a href=3D"=
https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.09436" data-original-href=3D"https://arxiv.org/a=
bs/1909.09436">research</a> used by OpenAI for <a href=3D"https://openai.co=
m/index/introducing-text-and-code-embeddings" data-original-href=3D"https:/=
/openai.com/index/introducing-text-and-code-embeddings">code understanding<=
/a>. I=E2=80=99ve also led and contributed to popular <a href=3D"https://ha=
mel.dev/oss/opensource.html" data-original-href=3D"https://hamel.dev/oss/op=
ensource.html">open-source</a> machine-learning tools.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>I=E2=80=99m currently working to bring data science back to AI: helping =
teams debug, analyze, and measure their systems. I call this =E2=80=9Cevals=
,=E2=80=9D and it=E2=80=99s the focus of my teaching, consulting, and writi=
ng.</p>
